# UI: shadcn first

Follow **UI conventions (all agents)** in `AGENTS.md`. Summary for Cursor:

- Prefer `components/ui/*` and existing wrappers before custom markup.
- Missing shadcn pieces: add via the **shadcn MCP** (`npx shadcn@latest mcp` / project MCP), not hand-rolled copies.
- Paginated resource tables: `DataTable` + server-side pagination (`components/data-table`, `src/features/shared/components/resource-table*`).
- Empty lists/tables: `components/ui/empty.tsx`.
- Searchable dropdowns: Combobox (Command + Popover); plain `Select` only for short fixed lists.
- Form field rows: top-align (`items-start`), not center/end — error text must not misalign siblings.
